{
  "sn35.32:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 35.32 ",
  "sn35.32:0.2": "3. Sabbavagga ",
  "sn35.32:0.3": "Dutiyasamugghātasappāyasutta ",
  "sn35.32:1.1": "“Sabbamaññitasamugghātasappāyaṁ vo, bhikkhave, paṭipadaṁ desessāmi. ",
  "sn35.32:1.2": "Taṁ suṇātha. ",
  "sn35.32:1.3": "Katamā ca sā, bhikkhave, sabbamaññitasamugghātasappāyā paṭipadā? ",
  "sn35.32:2.1": "Taṁ kiṁ maññatha, bhikkhave, ",
  "sn35.32:2.2": "cakkhu niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn35.32:3.1": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn35.32:4.1": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vā taṁ sukhaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn35.32:5.1": "“Dukkhaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn35.32:6.1": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vipariṇāmadhammaṁ, kallaṁ nu taṁ samanupassituṁ: ",
  "sn35.32:6.2": "‘etaṁ mama, esohamasmi, eso me attā’”ti? ",
  "sn35.32:7.1": "“No hetaṁ bhante”. ",
  "sn35.32:8.1": "“Rūpā …pe… ",
  "sn35.32:8.2": "cakkhuviññāṇaṁ … ",
  "sn35.32:8.3": "cakkhusamphasso nicco vā anicco vā”ti? ",
  "sn35.32:9.1": "“Anicco, bhante” …pe…. ",
  "sn35.32:10.1": "“Yampidaṁ cakkhusamphassapaccayā uppajjati vedayitaṁ sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā tampi niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn35.32:11.1": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn35.32:12.1": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vā taṁ sukhaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn35.32:13.1": "“Dukkhaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn35.32:14.1": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vipariṇāmadhammaṁ, kallaṁ nu ta